                    additional protocol, signed at Moscow on August 23, 1939; for text, see
                    Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Documents on German Foreign Policy,
                        1918–1945</hi>, series D, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>, pp.
                    245–247.</p>
            </note>
